    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10896" root="خضرم" body-key="x">
    
      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَضْرَمَ</span></b> , said of butter [in the process of
formation], <i>It became dissundered,</i> or <i>separated</i>
[<i>into clots</i>], <i>by reason of intense cold; and did
not coalesce;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحصرم</span>. (TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حصرم</span>.)

